# Density Compare
# Copernicium (Cn) — real density 23.7 g/cm³. equal masses: Copernicium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Copernicium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 7.0mm color: #ff1050 at (-20mm, 3.5mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 189.0 g — the water cube is the reference
